A can complete a piece of work in 15 days, and B can complete the same work in 10 days. If they work together, how many days will they take to complete the work?
A) 5 days
B) 6 days
C) 7 days
D) 8 days
Soluton:
       A = 1/15
       B = 1/10
      total work = 1/15+1/10
                   = 10+15/150
                   = 25/150
                    = 1/6

6 days
Answer: B
